# Fase 8 · Bloque 8.4 · Mejoras de proveedores (sin UI)
# Uso: Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code (extensión REST Client).
# Antes: dev-db.ps1 (aplica la migración 025 y R__ref__banks) y `dotnet run --project src/Server/Pos.Server.Host`.
# Requiere un proveedor (http/fase-05.http, paso 4b), un producto comprado y un segundo usuario ADMIN para verificar cuentas.

@host = http://localhost:5480
@api = {{host}}/api/v1
@supplierId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1. Entrar como Propietario
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "dueno", "password": "Sup3rmercado-Seguro" }

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 2. Ficha resumen (por defecto los últimos 90 días): comprado, # compras, última compra, saldo, vencido, devoluciones, productos activos
GET {{api}}/purchasing/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/summary?from=2026-07-01&to=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. ¿Quién me vende esto? (último costo solo con inventory.cost.view)
GET {{api}}/purchasing/products/{{productId}}/suppliers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Historial de costo neto por compra y proveedor (exige inventory.cost.view)
GET {{api}}/purchasing/products/{{productId}}/cost-history?from=2026-01-01&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Agenda y pedido mínimo (PUT reemplaza la agenda completa; dayOfWeek 1 = lunes … 7 = domingo; sin branchId = todas)
PUT {{api}}/purchasing/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minimumOrderAmount": 300000,
  "orderCutoffNote": "Pedidos hasta el lunes a las 10 a. m.",
  "entries": [
    { "dayOfWeek": 1, "kind": "Order", "notes": "Por WhatsApp al vendedor" },
    { "dayOfWeek": 1, "kind": "Visit" },
    { "dayOfWeek": 3, "kind": "Delivery" }
  ]
}

### 6. Consultar la agenda (con la próxima fecha de cada entrada)
GET {{api}}/purchasing/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Bancos (código ACH)
GET {{api}}/purchasing/banks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Registrar una cuenta bancaria: queda PENDING_VERIFICATION (auditoría CRÍTICA). Solo OWNER/ADMIN (o autorización de supervisor)
# @name account
POST {{api}}/purchasing/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/bank-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankCode": "1007", "accountType": "Savings", "accountNumber": "123-456789-01", "holderName": "Distribuidora Láctea SAS",
  "holderIdentificationType": "NIT", "holderIdentificationNumber": "800197268", "isPrimary": true
}

@accountId = {{account.response.body.id}}

### 9. Cuentas del proveedor con su estado
GET {{api}}/purchasing/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/bank-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Verificar: quien la registró recibe 422 PURCHASING.BANK_ACCOUNT_SAME_USER; debe hacerlo OTRO usuario con el permiso
POST {{api}}/purchasing/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/bank-accounts/{{accountId}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Modificar (cambiar el número la deja otra vez POR VERIFICAR; isActive=false la inactiva)
PUT {{api}}/purchasing/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/bank-accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankCode": "1007", "accountType": "Checking", "accountNumber": "98765432101", "holderName": "Distribuidora Láctea SAS",
  "holderIdentificationType": "NIT", "holderIdentificationNumber": "800197268", "isPrimary": true, "isActive": true
}

### 12. Pago por transferencia con la cuenta principal por verificar: se registra con "warnings": [PURCHASING.BANK_ACCOUNT_UNVERIFIED]
POST {{api}}/purchasing/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": "{{supplierId}}", "paymentMethodId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "reference": "TRF-801",
  "allocations": [ { "accountId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "amount": 50000 } ]
}

### 13. Retenciones sugeridas (una por tipo, tarifa en %): pre-llenan las compras nuevas que no traen retenciones
PUT {{api}}/purchasing/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/withholdings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "withholdings": [
    { "kind": "Retefuente", "rate": 2.5, "concept": "Compras generales" },
    { "kind": "Reteica", "rate": 0.414 }
  ]
}

### 14. Compra nueva SIN "withholdings": llegan pre-llenadas en el borrador para revisar y confirmar (RN-PUR-10)
POST {{api}}/purchasing/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": "{{supplierId}}", "warehouseId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "supplierInvoiceNumber": "FE-950",
  "invoiceDate": "2026-09-29", "paymentMode": "Credit", "proration": "Value", "chargesTotal": 0,
  "lines": [ { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 100, "unitCost": 2000 } ]
}

### 15. Vencimientos para el tablero: vencidas y las que vencen en los próximos 7 días
GET {{api}}/purchasing/payables/due?days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
